{
  "_comment": [
    "H2 translation table (plan 2c): inventory.json froze the LEGACY DOM on",
    "2026-08-27 with human route names and panel titles; the SPA marks its",
    "panels with parity=\"route.slug\" keys. The two vocabularies have no",
    "intersection by construction, so this file IS the intersection: every",
    "inventory route, panel title, tab and table key maps either to the SPA",
    "parity key that carries it, or to a named status with a note.",
    "Statuses: phase-5/phase-6 (route not built yet, per docs/design/08),",
    "retired (deliberately dropped, note says why), unmapped (DEBT - built",
    "route, missing piece). tests/unit/test_parity_keymap.py enforces the",
    "shape, the existence of every referenced parity key in the SPA source,",
    "and pins the unmapped count so debt cannot grow silently."
  ],
